{"id":"0fb51124547c895f","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-weak1generic-density-oscillation.md","title":"弱1泛型的位频率极端振荡","display":"thm-weak1generic-density-oscillation — 弱1泛型的位频率极端振荡","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-weak1generic-density-oscillation","aliases":["43-thm-weak1generic-density-oscillation"],"display":"thm-weak1generic-density-oscillation — 弱1泛型的位频率极端振荡","depends_on":["[[43-df-genericity]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§11.16.1, Kautz example following Theorem 11.16.17","source_printed_pages":"297–298","source_pdf_pages":"317–318","source_scope":"book-derived","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-weak1generic-density-oscillation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-weak1generic-density-oscillation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-weak1generic-density-oscillation — 弱1泛型的位频率极端振荡"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11.16.1, Kautz example following Theorem 11.16.17"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"297–298"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"317–318"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book-derived"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in2^\\omega\">\\(G\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}\">\\(\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_n\">\\(a_n\\)</span> 的定义只用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a_n\\coloneqq\\frac1n\\sum_{i&lt;n}G(i)\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a_n\\coloneqq\\frac1n\\sum_{i&lt;n}G(i)\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(G,1)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=0\\land\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=1\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(G,1)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=0\\land\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=1\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对每个k≥2和长度下界m，“长度至少m且1的频率≤1/k”的有限串集可计算且稠密；追加足够多0即可进入。频率≥1−1/k的串集也一样，追加足够多1即可进入。弱1泛型点逐一遇到它们，得两端极限。原书只明确写出3/4与1/4两阈值造成频率不存在；此处是同一论证对任意k的局部推广。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，§11.16.1, Kautz example following Theorem 11.16.17，印刷页297–298，PDF页317–318。本项为书内讨论的笔记内推导；未冒充原书逐字陈述。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-genericity]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}$ 采用 [[43-df-genericity]]。$a_n$ 的定义只用于 $n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}","display":false},{"tex":"a_n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"a_n\\coloneqq\\frac1n\\sum_{i<n}G(i)\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(G,1)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=0\\land\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=1\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1682,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-273","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-weak1generic-density-oscillation]] — 弱1泛型的位频率极端振荡"}],"outgoing":["39322da73a94b6b8"]}